            "notes": "The deck focuses on comboing off with Nomads en-Kor and Cephalid Illusionist to mill the library, then using Dread Return to bring back Thassa's Oracle for the win. Stoneforge Mystic can tutor up useful equipment like Orcish Bowmasters or Kaldra Compleat. Force of Will and Teferi, Time Raveler help protect the combo, while Urza's Saga can search for key pieces. The deck also includes disruption like Cabal Therapy and counter magic like Daze. The mana base includes fetch lands, dual lands, and utility lands like Karakas. Retrofitter Foundry provides additional synergy with the combo."
